<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi French Bank 1997 H1 net up 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Saudi French Bank 1997 H1 net up 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  208.3   vs    183.4</p>
<p> Operating income	1,030.9   vs    967.5</p>
<p> Operating expenses	832.3   vs    788.7</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  2,766.5   vs  2,653.1</p>
<p> Assets		   28,784.4   vs 26,979.7</p>
<p>Full Name: Al Bank Al Saudi Al Fransi.</p>
<p>Note - Paris-based Banque Indosuez, the banking arm of Compagnie de Suez, owns 31.1 percent in the Riyadh-based bank. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
